				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "###Spokes\nAccessible directly from the Hub, are methods providing direct access to useful tools or registries lurking around the system, that are useful, insightful even essential.\n### Hubs\nAre other Classes in the system that have been annotated to provide their own browsable Hub/Spoke/Utility/Wall features.\n#### Utilities\nAre simply useful class methods given exposure and made visible.\n###Wall\nAnd finally wall methods are specifically marked to define useful points of isolation.\n"
			},
